        <properties documentation="Segment in which the BASF products are used by the customer&#10;Grouping is mainly used by marketing.&#10;&#10;Sub-market segments are additional segmentation, sometines hierarchical (typically 3 levels) (e.g. ED)&#10;Industry &#9;&#9;-&gt; Main Segment &#9;&#9;&#9;-&gt; Application&#10;Construction&#9;N-EDN: Construction Coatings &#9;Waterproof Cement&#10;Fiber Bonding&#9;S-ED/S: Carpets   (BU-specific)&#10;&#10;Examples: Food industry; animal nutrition, human nutrition, Agro,  Automotive,  Petrol&#10;&#10;is Industry Business Area really a synonym to market segment??" isSpecification="false" sType="Class" nType="0" scope="public" stereotype="Entity" isRoot="false" isLeaf="false" isAbstract="false" isActive="false"/>
